[h2]Greetings Architects![/h2]

[url=https://steamcommunity.com/games/1468400/announcements/detail/3019069421684537376]In the last devlog[/url] we have been on a little trip to Los Angeles, and today we should enjoy the carnival!ːsteamhappyː
[img]https://i.imgur.com/xP0Nh4T.jpg[/img]

estimated casualties are:
[list]
[*] 3 cases of cola and 500+ cups of Caffe per developer
[*] 849 keyboards - one per Unreal Engine crash, we have ordered military-grade keyboards now and stop counting.
[*] [url=https://i.imgur.com/OwelBFF.jpg]Arthurs hat[/url] as he ate it. Now he looks ridiculous and running from the camera.
[/list]
We had no time to prepare Carnival content. But we were able to implement some fancy coded mechanics to Dreamhouse: The Game and now we want to share it with You.
[olist]
[*]Interpolation and Extrapolation - long story short it will allow smooth multiplayer experience. 
For those more interested in the subject [url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rD90rTjy5Yo]there is an excellent video on Youtube explains it further.[/url]
[*]A dynamic crosshair has been added;

[*]Attraction, lifting and rotating of objects system has been added:
[previewyoutube=4HefCoCFfYk;full][/previewyoutube][i]We need to play with a gamma a little...[/i]
[list]
[h3]Attraction[/h3]
[*]attractor visualisation;
[*]attraction taking into account the type of object (a hat can be put on the head but not on foot, etc.);
[*]polarity of attraction - so the flower can be put into a pot but not into another flower or ceiling, or fridge doors;
[*]smooth animation transitions;
[*]blocking of attraction to an occupied slot has been added;
[*]taking into account the current rotation of the object when attracting - if the item is turned sideways to the slot the game will not offer to attract it;
[*]the possibility to attach several objects, which will be taken into account by the game as one;
[h3]Lifting and rotating of objects[/h3]
[*]added dynamic holding distance based on object size;
[*]added protection against physics errors and launching into space;
[*]added dynamic centre of grasp based on the centre of mass;
[/list][/olist]
Since we already have a kitchen then we will have some fun during this carnival and eat tons of doughnuts (Fat Tuesday tradition). See You in two weeks! 25.02.2021. Or sooner on our [url=https://discord.gg/PTb2Dg6Uf7]Discord Server[/url].

Yours
DeSand "Dreamhouse: The Game" Team
